ormance rival of the US Army  tactical missile system yes those same  missiles that Kiev is so insistently  asking Washington for and they may be  receiving them now for the time being  the k239 chin move is already  operational in the South Korean Armed  Forces has been exported to the United  Arab Emirates and has been sold to  Poland the latter country has finalized  a contract for 288 units at the cost of  reducing its high Mars orders which were  to be significantly delayed  so there you have it the South Korean  arms industry is experiencing a golden  era and the best thing is then this may  only be the beginning artillery Fighters  missiles tanks and keep in mind that  this could obviously have many  implications South Korea may not only  contribute to the rearmament of Western  countries but may also become a  formidable Fortress to be added to the  Allied Forces seeking to contain China  in the region the question is will South  Korea succeed in establishing itself as  one of the four or perhaps even three  largest arms exporters in the world will  we see any of these promising weapons  operating in more European countries you  can leave your opinion here Below in the  comments and remember if you like this  video don't forget to hit the like  button and subscribe to our channel so  you don't miss any news once again thank  you so very much for being there all the  best see you next time  [Music]

